.cloudflare-*.local
.wrangler/
*.pem
*.key
# The pilot's sealing PUBLIC key is a committed ceremony input: reviewers seal
# to it and the carrier check requires it at the carrier commit. Without this
# exception `git add -A` skips it silently and the carrier lands incomplete.
# The private half never enters the repository, and this exception is scoped
# to one filename so it cannot admit one by accident.
!calibration/*/label-sealing-public-key.pem
*.crt
*.p12

